flowchart TD
 Select[Select regular file] --> Validate{Valid size and name?}
 Validate -->|Yes| Hash[Hash source]
 Validate -->|No| Error[Surface error]
 Hash --> Dial[Dial and negotiate]
 Dial --> Stream[Stream chunks]
 Stream --> Verify{Size and digest match?}
 Verify -->|Yes| Commit[Sync / rename / record / ack]
 Verify -->|No| Cleanup[Remove temporary file]
 Stream -->|Cancel or interruption| Cleanup
 Cleanup --> Error
